OL,3,GNEWSADemand for school uniform bank
OL,4,A'has never been higher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity offering parents the chance
OL,7,Fto pick up second hand school uniforms
OL,8,Ffor free said demand for its services
OL,9,F"has never been higher".
OL,11,FWirral Free Uniforms for Schools, which
OL,12,Fhas 12 hubs across Wirral and has been
OL,13,Fgoing for 14 years, said uniforms are
OL,14,Fstill rising in price despite
OL,15,Fgovernment guidelines.
OL,17,FDemand has risen even in "affluent
OL,18,Fareas" thanks to "posher schools"
OL,19,Fcharging high fees for certain
OL,20,Fmandatory uniform items, it said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
