OL,3,GNEWSADemand for school uniform bank
OL,4,A'has never been higher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProject co-ordinator Petra Davies said:
OL,7,F"The cost of uniform, despite the
OL,8,Fgovernment guidelines, is still rising
OL,9,Fin price and people just cannot afford
OL,10,Fit."
